<title>UK: Savoy sells 2 restaurants to Chez Gerard.</title>
<headline>Savoy sells 2 restaurants to Chez Gerard.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Savoy Hotel Plc said on Thursday that it had exchanged contracts to sell its two Knightsbridge restaurants to Groupe Chez Gerard Plc, the London-based restaurant group, for 2.0 million stg.</p>
<p>The two restaurants -- Grill St Quentin and Brasserie St Quentin -- had sales of 2.6 million stg and profits of 400,000 stg in 1996, Savoy said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4365</p>
</text>
